{"id":"wb-6-1011","name":"中共湘区委员会旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中共湘区委员会旧址","text":"中共湘区委员会旧址（中共湘区委员会旧址暨毛泽东、杨开慧故居）坐落在湖南省长沙市八一路清水塘长沙党史馆内，是长沙市经历文夕大火唯一幸存的关于中共革命历史建筑物。因旧址位于清水塘，而经常直接被称作“清水塘”。旧址原为清水塘22号，属一陶姓商人住宅，典型南方民居风格，南北朝向，建筑面积112平方米，占地面积179平方米。旧址原为毛泽东和杨开慧旧居。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E6%B9%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%A7%94%E5%91%98%E4%BC%9A%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93355666,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93355666","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/233ad69c4b1dda71f2c95a33.jpg","title":"Site_of_Hunan_Council_of_China_Communist_Party,_2018-09-27_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Site_of_Hunan_Council_of_China_Communist_Party,_2018-09-27_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Site_of_Hunan_Council_of_China_Communist_Party%2C_2018-09-27_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​中共湘区委员会旧址","width":320,"height":214}}